========================================================================
 arch-rails-server live media
 Kamal-ready Arch host installer kit
========================================================================

  Kit path:  /opt/arch-rails-server
  Helper:    ars help

  Typical flow:
    1. ars status          # network + kit present?
    2. ars keys            # optional: bake-in check for authorized_keys
    3. archinstall         # or: ars archinstall
    4. After install, before reboot:
         ars copy-to-target
         arch-chroot /mnt /opt/arch-rails-server/bin/bootstrap
    5. reboot → ./bin/verify on the new host

  Docs on this media:  less /opt/arch-rails-server/docs/INSTALL.md
                       less /opt/arch-rails-server/docs/USB.md

